    "name": {
      "value": "Final Blade Survivor"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You fell prey to the whims of the Galtan mob and were scheduled for execution by final blade, but through skill—or sheer luck—you managed to talk your way out of it.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Charisma or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Deception skill and the Revolution Lore skill. You gain the Charming Liar skill feat."
    },
